+        //   players   every PLAYER in ff9.player, ORDER-FREE (a commutative sum of per-character words, each keyed by its CharacterId: the loader
+        //             writes players back through GetPlayer(slot_no), so the dictionary's order is not state): name, category, level, exp, cur and
+        //             max (hp, mp, at, at_coef, capa), trance, wep_bone, elem, defence, basis (max_hp, max_mp, dex, str, mgc, wpr, capa,
+        //             max_capa), info (slot_no, serial_no, row, win_pose, party, menu_type, sub_replaced), status, equip x5, bonus (dex, str, mgc,
+        //             wpr, cap), pa[], sa[2], saExtended (order-free: a set) and the four limits. NetFingerprint alone is not enough: it misses
